rivial phase gradient\n      (d_z 0.33-0.44, all CIs exclude zero), suggesting strategy-dependence of compound\n      severity is architecture-modulated.' 这是 median 档核心论点：phase gradient universal，\n      strategy specificity architecture-dependent。\n\n  - name: \"c8_llama_gpu0_s025_preemptive\"\n    plan_id: \"c8_llama_gpu0_s025\"\n    description: \"LLaMA importance s025 单条件预加速（n=250），作为 c8_llama_n250_fixed 的一部分\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 250\n      n_valid: 245\n      importance_s025_median_ii_low: 1.82\n      importance_s025_median_ii_high: 0.085\n      importance_s025_median_diff: 0.088\n      importance_s025_phase_gradient_dz: 1.08\n      importance_s025_phase_gradient_ci: [0.82, 1.38]\n      importance_s025_wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n    result_rationale: >\n      这是 c8_llama_n250_fixed 中的一个子条件。LLaMA importance s025 在 n=50 时 phase gradient\n      d_z=1.1227 (CI [0.87, 1.58])。n=250 时 CI 缩窄至 [0.82, 1.38]，中心估计稳定在~1.08。\n      这是 within-importance 效应（不涉及 imp_vs_rand 比较），本身是 large effect，n=250 只是\n      增加精度。Median II 值与 n=50 的 median_diff=0.0947 基本一致（大样本回归到更稳定估计）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"预期完全符合 n=50 结论，仅 CI 缩窄。不改变任何 claim。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s015\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s015\"\n    description: \"GPQA Diamond (n=198) × DeepSeek-R1 × importance × s015, quantile三分相位\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      n_valid: 185\n      mid_null_rate: 0.15\n      importance_s015_median_ii_low: 0.28\n      importance_s015_median_ii_mid: 0.09\n      importance_s015_median_ii_high: 0.018\n      importance_s015_median_diff: 0.24\n      importance_s015_ci: [0.12, 0.42]\n      importance_s015_wilcoxon_p: 0.0008\n      phase_gradient_dz: 0.52\n      phase_gradient_monotonic: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      GPQA Diamond 是非数学推理任务（科学 QA），推理链比 MATH-500 短~40%，phase 结构不如数学\n      清晰。s015 是最低 sparsity——在 MATH-500 上 DS imp s015 median_diff=0.39，但 GPQA 推理链\n      更短意味着 low-sparsity phase 的 token 数更少、II 累积效应弱化。预期 median_diff ~0.24\n      （约为 MATH-500 的 60%），但仍显著（n=198 提供充足功效）。Phase gradient monotonic 但\n      magnitude 衰减：与 GSM8K 模式一致——更简单/更短的推理链 → phase modulation 效应变弱。\n      这支持 median 档的 cross_benchmark_phase_gradient_monotonic_count: 2-3 预测。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-benchmark s015 comparison\"\n        columns: [\"benchmark\", \"DS_imp_s015_median_diff\", \"reasoning_chain_length\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MATH-500\", \"0.39\", \"long (avg ~550 tokens)\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"0.241\", \"medium (avg ~300 tokens)\"]\n          - [\"GPQA Diamond\", \"0.24 (predicted)\", \"medium-short (avg ~350 tokens)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Bar chart comparing phase gradient magnitude at s015 across three benchmarks, showing consistent monotonic decrease with reasoning chain complexity.\"\n    analysis: >\n      GPQA s015 单条件预期 PASS——phase gradient 存在且显著。但 magnitude 低于 MATH-500，\n      与 median 档预期一致。关键意义：证明 phase modulation 不限于数学推理，也存在于科学 QA，\n      但 specificity ratio 可能更低（需要完整 random 对照才能计算）。\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_full_pipeline\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_diamond_full\"\n    description: \"GPQA Diamond (n=198) × DS+QW × importance(×4 sparsity) + random(×2 controls s025/s030) = 10 runs\"\n    expected_results:\n      ds_importance:\n        s015:\n          median_gradient: 0.24\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.0008\n        s020:\n          median_gradient: 0.68\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n        s025:\n          median_gradient: 1.85\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n        s030:\n          median_gradient: 3.92\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n      qw_importance:\n        s015:\n          median_gradient: 0.04\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.02\n        s020:\n          median_gradient: 0.19\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.0005\n        s025:\n          median_gradient: 0.72\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n        s030:\n          median_gradient: 1.68\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n      ds_random:\n        s025:\n          median_gradient: 0.58\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.03\n        s030:\n          median_gradient: 1.21\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.008\n      qw_random:\n        s025:\n          median_gradient: 0.31\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.06\n        s030:\n          median_gradient: 0.72\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.02\n      imp_rand_ratio:\n        ds_s025: 3.2\n        ds_s030: 3.2\n        qw_s025: 2.3\n        qw_s030: 2.3\n      dose_response_monotonic_ds: true\n      dose_response_monotonic_qw: true\n      strategy_specificity_ratio_range: \"2.3-3.2×\"\n      cross_benchmark_phase_gradient_monotonic: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档核心预测：strategy_specificity_ratio_new_benchmark = [2.0, 4.9]。GPQA 作为\n      非数学推理 benchmark：(1) 推理链更短→ phase 区分度降低→ phase gradient magnitude 约为\n      MATH-500 的 55-65%（类似 GSM8K 衰减模式）；(2) Random eviction 在 GPQA 上也会显示\n      更强的 phase gradient（因为任务推理结构不如数学严格，attention 模式更分散），\n      导致 imp/rand ratio 从 MATH-500 的 15× 衰减至 2-4×；(3) 两模型 importance gradient\n      均 monotonic（cross_benchmark_phase_gradient_monotonic_count 达到 3/3）——phase\n      gradient 的 universality 是 median 档确认的核心结论；(4) QW imp s015 可能 borderline\n      （p=0.02 uncorrected，Bonferroni 后 NS），与 QW onset threshold s≥0.20 一致。\n      DS random s025 预期 borderline 显著——GPQA 的 random 比 MATH-500 更容易显著，因为\n      任务本身 phase structure 更弱→ random 和 importance 的差异缩小。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Strategy specificity ratio across benchmarks\"\n        columns: [\"benchmark\", \"DS_ratio_s025\", \"DS_ratio_s030\", \"QW_ratio_s025\", \"QW_ratio_s030\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MATH-500 (n=500)\", \"15.5×\", \"16.6×\", \"2.7×\", \"3.5×\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K (n=50)\", \"3.8×\", \"2.8×\", \"~3×\", \"~2.5×\"]\n          - [\"GPQA Diamond (n=198, predicted)\", \"3.2×\", \"3.2×\", \"2.3×\", \"2.3×\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Dose-response comparison (DS importance median_gradient)\"\n        columns: [\"sparsity\", \"MATH-500\", \"GSM8K\", \"GPQA (predicted)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s015\", \"0.39\", \"0.241\", \"0.24\"]\n          - [\"s020\", \"1.21\", \"0.740\", \"0.68\"]\n          - [\"s025\", \"3.99\", \"1.992\", \"1.85\"]\n          - [\"s030\", \"8.48\", \"4.682\", \"3.92\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Three-panel dose-response curves (MATH-500 / GSM8K / GPQA) showing parallel monotonic gradients with benchmark-dependent magnitude scaling.\"\n      - \"Fig: Strategy specificity heatmap (benchmark × sparsity × model) demonstrating systematic attenuation from MATH-500 (15×) → GSM8K (3×) → GPQA (3×).\"\n    analysis: >\n      GPQA 完整数据将强化 C10 的叙事方向：phase gradient 跨 benchmark 稳健（3/3 monotonic），\n      但 strategy specificity 高度 task-dependent（15× → 3× → 3×）。论文 Discussion 需要\n      一段专门解释 specificity 衰减的可能机制：更短的推理链 → phase boundary 更模糊 →\n      random eviction 在\"错误\" phase 的概率上升 → imp/rand 区分缩小。这是 median 档要求\n      的 \"softened language\" 之一：不能说 \"strategy specificity is a universal property\"，\n      必须限定为 \"strongest on complex mathematical reasoning with long CoT\"。\n\n  - name: \"qwen25_14b_math500\"\n    plan_id: \"14b_scale_extension\"\n    description: \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct × MATH-500 × importance(×4 sparsity) + random(s030) = 5 runs\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 50\n      importance:\n        s015:\n          median_diff: 0.055\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.008\n          cohens_d: 0.42\n        s020:\n          median_diff: 0.28\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.0003\n          cohens_d: 0.68\n        s025:\n          median_diff: 0.92\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n          cohens_d: 1.05\n        s030:\n          median_diff: 2.35\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n          cohens_d: 1.28\n      random_s030:\n        median_diff: 0.68\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.02\n        phase_gradient_dz: 0.38\n      imp_rand_ratio_s030: 3.5\n      dose_response_monotonic: true\n      dose_response_spearman_rho: 1.0\n      phase_gradient_importance_dz:\n        s015: 0.85\n        s020: 0.92\n        s025: 1.02\n        s030: 0.95\n      onset_threshold: \"s015 (similar to QW-7B)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      14B 模型相对 7B 有更多 attention heads (40→40 for 14B GQA, 但 KV heads 从 8→8)，\n      实际 GQA 结构意味着 head pruning 的冗余度不同。预期：(1) Phase gradient 依然 monotonic\n      且 d_z~1.0（与 Qwen2-7B 一致，因为 phase modulation 是 reasoning structure 的属性，\n      不强依赖模型规模）；(2) Absolute magnitude 可能比 7B 略小（14B 更鲁棒，residual stream\n      容量更大）——median_diff ~2.35 vs 7B 的 3.16 at s030；(3) Strategy specificity ratio\n      ~3.5×（14B random 也更难产生大 gradient，因为冗余更多）；(4) Onset threshold 仍在 s015\n      （与 7B Qwen 一致，架构决定而非规模决定）。Median 档预期：这个实验不会 dramatically 改变\n      故事，但为 Limitations 中的 \"7B only\" 提供部分回应。Cohen's d 范围 0.42→1.28 落在\n      qw_cohens_d_range [0.37, 1.44] 内。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 14B vs 7B Qwen importance dose-response\"\n        columns: [\"sparsity\", \"QW-7B_median_diff (n=500)\", \"QW-14B_predicted (n=50)\", \"ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s015\", \"0.066\", \"0.055\", \"0.83×\"]\n          - [\"s020\", \"0.307\", \"0.28\", \"0.91×\"]\n          - [\"s025\", \"1.075\", \"0.92\", \"0.86×\"]\n          - [\"s030\", \"3.155\", \"2.35\", \"0.74×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Dual dose-response curve (7B vs 14B) with shared x-axis (sparsity) showing parallel scaling with 14B ~20-25% lower magnitude.\"\n    analysis: >\n      14B 实验是 reviewer concern RC1 (7B only) 的直接回应。Median 档预期：定性完全复制\n      （monotonic, strategy×phase interaction），定量略弱（magnitude ~75-90% of 7B）。\n      论文加一句：\"Preliminary results on Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct (n=50) replicate the\n      monotonic phase gradient (Spearman ρ=1.0, all d_z>0.8), suggesting the phenomenon\n      is not scale-specific within the 7-14B range. Larger-scale validation remains\n      future work.\" 这足够回应 reviewer 而不需要 14B 的完整 n=500 replication。\n\n  - name: \"c10_lang_s020_s025_analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"c10_lang_s020_s025\"\n    description: \"MATH-500 language switching at s020/s025, 补全 dense→s015→s020→s025→s030 全链\"\n    expected_results:\n      s020:\n        switch_rate: 0.14\n        cn_count: 7\n        en_count: 43\n        cn_acc: 0.33\n        en_acc: 0.25\n      s025:\n        switch_rate: 0.32\n        cn_count: 16\n        en_count: 34\n        cn_acc: 0.20\n        en_acc: 0.057\n      full_chain_switch_rate: [0.0, 0.04, 0.14, 0.32, 0.40]\n      monotonic: true\n      correlation_switch_vs_ii: 0.55\n    result_rationale: >\n      这个实验已经完成（registry 显示 success）。实际结果与 median 档吻合：language switching\n      单调递增 (0%→4%→14%→32%→40%)，是 compound degradation 的 behavioral manifestation。\n      Switch rate 与 II 相关但不完美(r≈0.55)——因为 switching 是离散二元事件而 II 是连续量，\n      且 switching 受模型 tokenizer 双语 capability 影响（architecture-specific confound）。\n      Median 档解读：这个数据支持论文的 Discussion 段落（compound sparsity 不仅影响数值推理\n      能力，还影响 language coherence），但不能作为独立 claim——它是 severity 的 symptom 而非\n      独立发现。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Language switching dose-response\"\n        columns: [\"sparsity\", \"switch_rate\", \"cn_acc\", \"en_acc\", \"overall_acc\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"dense\", \"0%\", \"N/A\", \"0.52\", \"0.52\"]\n          - [\"s015\", \"4%\", \"0%\", \"0.375\", \"0.36\"]\n          - [\"s020\", \"14%\", \"0.33\", \"0.25\", \"0.26\"]\n          - [\"s025\", \"32%\", \"0.20\", \"0.057\", \"0.10\"]\n          - [\"s030\", \"40%\", \"0.10\", \"0.10\", \"0.10\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Dual-axis plot—left axis: accuracy decline; right axis: Chinese switching rate. Both monotonic, showing compound sparsity triggers multilingual collapse.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Language switching 数据已完成，为 Appendix 提供额外 behavioral evidence。\n      不改变核心 claims。Median 档下，这属于 'nice-to-have supplementary evidence' 而非\n      论文主线。§6 Discussion 加一段提及即可。\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_think_validation\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_think_validation\"\n    description: \"GPQA Diamond </think> phase segmentation validation (Run 2, supplementary)\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      n_valid: 180\n      median_kappa: 0.82\n      thinking_in_low_sparsity_phase: 0.72\n      answer_in_high_sparsity_phase: 0.58\n      temporal_ordering: 0.51\n    result_rationale: >\n      GPQA 的 </think> validation 预期 kappa 略低于 MATH-500 (0.88)——GPQA 是多选题，\n      推理链结构更不规则（有些问题直接选答案，有些有长推理）。Kappa=0.82 仍在 'substantial\n      agreement' 范围。thinking_in_low=0.72（低于 MATH-500 的 0.82）因为 GPQA 推理链更短\n      导致 low-sparsity phase 混合了更多 transition 内容。Answer_in_high=0.58（低于\n      MATH-500 的 0.66）因为 GPQA 答案部分通常只有一个字母选项，token 数极少，phase\n      assignment 更不稳定。Temporal ordering 更低（0.51 vs 0.58）因为 GPQA 非线性推理\n      较多（排除法、回溯等）。这些都是 median 档预期——kappa 仍然 acceptable 但 phase\n      alignment 指标比数学弱。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Appendix figure showing kappa distribution across GPQA problems (histogram) vs MATH-500 overlay.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Supplementary validation，放 Appendix。如果 kappa<0.75 则需要承认 quantile \n      segmentation 在 GPQA 上不如 MATH-500 可靠——但 0.82 仍然足够支持主结论。\n      不影响论文主线 claims。\n```\n\n**总结**：\n\nMedian 档下，5 个 running/planned 实验的预测核心结论：\n1. **c8_llama_n250**: 不改变 partially_confirmed 判定——CI 缩窄但效应量不变（d_z≈0.33），仅 s030 Bonferroni 显著\n2. **GPQA Diamond**: Phase gradient 复现（第 3 个 monotonic benchmark），但 specificity ratio 衰减至 2-4×\n3. **14B Qwen**: 定性复制 7B，magnitude 略弱（~75-85%），为 RC1 提供部分回应\n4. **Language switching**: 已完成，作为 supplementary evidence 放 Appendix\n5. **GPQA think validation**: Kappa ~0.82，acceptable 但弱于 MATH-500"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3149,"cache_read_input_tokens":83040,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3149},"output_tokens":12,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"26848798-3f45-4312-987c-61341c081737","uuid":"ee2abda9-9128-4747-a628-808becffd2c8"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":228139,"duration_api_ms":232168,"num_turns":8,"result":"Now I have the full picture. The experiment_plan has all 38 experiments as DONE, but there are RUNNING/QUEUED experiments in the registry and planned scope extensions in the ROADMAP that constitute the \"planned\" experiments. Let me generate median-tier predictions for these.\n\n```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: \"Phase gradient核心发现稳健，但strategy specificity强度和机制覆盖度需要显著限定。LLaMA n=250不会改变n=50的定性结论——imp_vs_rand交互仍为small effect，仅s030 Bonferroni显著。GPQA Diamond作为new benchmark，strategy specificity ratio预期衰减至2-4×（远低于MATH-500的15×）。论文Claims需三处调整：Title/Abstract软化、C8改写为partial support、Mechanism §降级。\"\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"c8_llama_n250_fixed\"\n    plan_id: \"c8_llama_n250_fixed\"\n    description: \"LLaMA-8B (DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B) n=250, 8 conditions (importance/random × s015/s020/s025/s030), MATH-500\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 250\n      n_valid: 245\n      phase_gradient_importance_dz:\n        s015: 0.98\n        s020: 1.05\n        s025: 1.08\n        s030: 0.97\n      phase_gradient_importance_interpretation: \"all_large\"\n      phase_gradient_random_dz:\n        s015: 0.33\n        s020: 0.37\n        s025: 0.42\n        s030: 0.44\n      phase_gradient_random_interpretation: \"all_small_but_significant\"\n      imp_vs_rand_dz:\n        s015: 0.18\n        s020: 0.24\n        s025: 0.28\n        s030: 0.33\n      imp_vs_rand_dz_monotonic: true\n      wilcoxon_p_bonferroni:\n        s015: 0.34\n        s020: 0.12\n        s025: 0.065\n        s030: 0.018\n      significant_bonferroni:\n        s015: false\n        s020: false\n        s025: false\n        s030: true\n      median_diff:\n        s015: 0.019\n        s020: 0.024\n        s025: 0.088\n        s030: 0.31\n      median_diff_ci:\n        s015: [0.005, 0.035]\n        s020: [-0.02, 0.08]\n        s025: [0.01, 0.21]\n        s030: [0.05, 0.48]\n      random_phase_gradient_ci_excludes_zero:\n        s015: true\n        s020: true\n        s025: true\n        s030: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      n=50→n=250 功效提升（~2.2× SE缩减）不足以将 small effect (d_z≈0.3) 推过 Bonferroni 门槛\n      （需 d_z>0.4 在 n=250 时达显著）。s030 的 d_z=0.33 刚好在边缘——n=250 将其 p 值从 0.029 压至\n      ~0.018，仍然显著。s025 (d_z≈0.28) 在 n=250 时 uncorrected p≈0.016 但 Bonferroni×4 后\n      p≈0.065 仍不显著。关键：这不是 power 问题——效应本身就小，LLaMA 架构上 strategy×phase 交互\n      弱是 true effect。Random phase gradient (d_z 0.33-0.44) CIs 将全部排除零（n=250 时\n      d_z>0.2 即可），确认 LLaMA 上 random 也有 non-trivial phase gradient——这是与 DeepSeek/Qwen\n      的关键架构差异。整体结论：within-importance phase gradient 强且稳健(d_z~1.0)，\n      imp_vs_rand 交互弱但方向正确(monotonic increasing)，定性结论与 n=50 完全一致。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LLaMA n=250 vs n=50 comparison\"\n        columns: [\"metric\", \"n=50_value\", \"n=250_predicted\", \"change\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"imp_vs_rand_dz_s030\", \"0.3352\", \"0.33\", \"stable (CI narrower)\"]\n          - [\"Bonferroni_sig_count\", \"1/4\", \"1/4\", \"no change\"]\n          - [\"random_phase_dz_mean\", \"0.40\", \"0.39\", \"stable\"]\n          - [\"importance_phase_dz_mean\", \"1.06\", \"1.02\", \"stable\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Forest plot showing imp_vs_rand d_z with 95% CI for s015-s030, n=50 vs n=250 overlay. Both show same pattern—CIs narrow but effect remains small.\"\n      - \"Fig: Phase gradient d_z comparison (importance vs random) across 4 sparsity levels, demonstrating LLaMA's unique pattern where random also shows significant gradient.\"\n    analysis: >\n      n=250 确认 C8 partially_confirmed 不变。论文写法：'At n=250, LLaMA replicates the\n      within-importance phase gradient (d_z≈1.0, all levels p<0.001) but the strategy×phase\n      interaction remains small (d_z 0.18-0.33) with only s030 reaching Bonferroni significance\n      (p=0.018). Critically, random masking on LLaMA shows a non-trivial phase gradient\n      (d_z 0.33-0.44, all CIs exclude zero), suggesting strategy-dependence of compound\n      severity is architecture-modulated.' 这是 median 档核心论点：phase gradient universal，\n      strategy specificity architecture-dependent。\n\n  - name: \"c8_llama_gpu0_s025_preemptive\"\n    plan_id: \"c8_llama_gpu0_s025\"\n    description: \"LLaMA importance s025 单条件预加速（n=250），作为 c8_llama_n250_fixed 的一部分\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 250\n      n_valid: 245\n      importance_s025_median_ii_low: 1.82\n      importance_s025_median_ii_high: 0.085\n      importance_s025_median_diff: 0.088\n      importance_s025_phase_gradient_dz: 1.08\n      importance_s025_phase_gradient_ci: [0.82, 1.38]\n      importance_s025_wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n    result_rationale: >\n      这是 c8_llama_n250_fixed 中的一个子条件。LLaMA importance s025 在 n=50 时 phase gradient\n      d_z=1.1227 (CI [0.87, 1.58])。n=250 时 CI 缩窄至 [0.82, 1.38]，中心估计稳定在~1.08。\n      这是 within-importance 效应（不涉及 imp_vs_rand 比较），本身是 large effect，n=250 只是\n      增加精度。Median II 值与 n=50 的 median_diff=0.0947 基本一致（大样本回归到更稳定估计）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"预期完全符合 n=50 结论，仅 CI 缩窄。不改变任何 claim。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s015\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s015\"\n    description: \"GPQA Diamond (n=198) × DeepSeek-R1 × importance × s015, quantile三分相位\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      n_valid: 185\n      mid_null_rate: 0.15\n      importance_s015_median_ii_low: 0.28\n      importance_s015_median_ii_mid: 0.09\n      importance_s015_median_ii_high: 0.018\n      importance_s015_median_diff: 0.24\n      importance_s015_ci: [0.12, 0.42]\n      importance_s015_wilcoxon_p: 0.0008\n      phase_gradient_dz: 0.52\n      phase_gradient_monotonic: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      GPQA Diamond 是非数学推理任务（科学 QA），推理链比 MATH-500 短~40%，phase 结构不如数学\n      清晰。s015 是最低 sparsity——在 MATH-500 上 DS imp s015 median_diff=0.39，但 GPQA 推理链\n      更短意味着 low-sparsity phase 的 token 数更少、II 累积效应弱化。预期 median_diff ~0.24\n      （约为 MATH-500 的 60%），但仍显著（n=198 提供充足功效）。Phase gradient monotonic 但\n      magnitude 衰减：与 GSM8K 模式一致——更简单/更短的推理链 → phase modulation 效应变弱。\n      这支持 median 档的 cross_benchmark_phase_gradient_monotonic_count: 2-3 预测。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-benchmark s015 comparison\"\n        columns: [\"benchmark\", \"DS_imp_s015_median_diff\", \"reasoning_chain_length\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MATH-500\", \"0.39\", \"long (avg ~550 tokens)\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"0.241\", \"medium (avg ~300 tokens)\"]\n          - [\"GPQA Diamond\", \"0.24 (predicted)\", \"medium-short (avg ~350 tokens)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Bar chart comparing phase gradient magnitude at s015 across three benchmarks, showing consistent monotonic decrease with reasoning chain complexity.\"\n    analysis: >\n      GPQA s015 单条件预期 PASS——phase gradient 存在且显著。但 magnitude 低于 MATH-500，\n      与 median 档预期一致。关键意义：证明 phase modulation 不限于数学推理，也存在于科学 QA，\n      但 specificity ratio 可能更低（需要完整 random 对照才能计算）。\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_full_pipeline\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_diamond_full\"\n    description: \"GPQA Diamond (n=198) × DS+QW × importance(×4 sparsity) + random(×2 controls s025/s030) = 10 runs\"\n    expected_results:\n      ds_importance:\n        s015:\n          median_gradient: 0.24\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.0008\n        s020:\n          median_gradient: 0.68\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n        s025:\n          median_gradient: 1.85\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n        s030:\n          median_gradient: 3.92\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n      qw_importance:\n        s015:\n          median_gradient: 0.04\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.02\n        s020:\n          median_gradient: 0.19\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.0005\n        s025:\n          median_gradient: 0.72\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n        s030:\n          median_gradient: 1.68\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n      ds_random:\n        s025:\n          median_gradient: 0.58\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.03\n        s030:\n          median_gradient: 1.21\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.008\n      qw_random:\n        s025:\n          median_gradient: 0.31\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.06\n        s030:\n          median_gradient: 0.72\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.02\n      imp_rand_ratio:\n        ds_s025: 3.2\n        ds_s030: 3.2\n        qw_s025: 2.3\n        qw_s030: 2.3\n      dose_response_monotonic_ds: true\n      dose_response_monotonic_qw: true\n      strategy_specificity_ratio_range: \"2.3-3.2×\"\n      cross_benchmark_phase_gradient_monotonic: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档核心预测：strategy_specificity_ratio_new_benchmark = [2.0, 4.9]。GPQA 作为\n      非数学推理 benchmark：(1) 推理链更短→ phase 区分度降低→ phase gradient magnitude 约为\n      MATH-500 的 55-65%（类似 GSM8K 衰减模式）；(2) Random eviction 在 GPQA 上也会显示\n      更强的 phase gradient（因为任务推理结构不如数学严格，attention 模式更分散），\n      导致 imp/rand ratio 从 MATH-500 的 15× 衰减至 2-4×；(3) 两模型 importance gradient\n      均 monotonic（cross_benchmark_phase_gradient_monotonic_count 达到 3/3）——phase\n      gradient 的 universality 是 median 档确认的核心结论；(4) QW imp s015 可能 borderline\n      （p=0.02 uncorrected，Bonferroni 后 NS），与 QW onset threshold s≥0.20 一致。\n      DS random s025 预期 borderline 显著——GPQA 的 random 比 MATH-500 更容易显著，因为\n      任务本身 phase structure 更弱→ random 和 importance 的差异缩小。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Strategy specificity ratio across benchmarks\"\n        columns: [\"benchmark\", \"DS_ratio_s025\", \"DS_ratio_s030\", \"QW_ratio_s025\", \"QW_ratio_s030\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MATH-500 (n=500)\", \"15.5×\", \"16.6×\", \"2.7×\", \"3.5×\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K (n=50)\", \"3.8×\", \"2.8×\", \"~3×\", \"~2.5×\"]\n          - [\"GPQA Diamond (n=198, predicted)\", \"3.2×\", \"3.2×\", \"2.3×\", \"2.3×\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Dose-response comparison (DS importance median_gradient)\"\n        columns: [\"sparsity\", \"MATH-500\", \"GSM8K\", \"GPQA (predicted)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s015\", \"0.39\", \"0.241\", \"0.24\"]\n          - [\"s020\", \"1.21\", \"0.740\", \"0.68\"]\n          - [\"s025\", \"3.99\", \"1.992\", \"1.85\"]\n          - [\"s030\", \"8.48\", \"4.682\", \"3.92\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Three-panel dose-response curves (MATH-500 / GSM8K / GPQA) showing parallel monotonic gradients with benchmark-dependent magnitude scaling.\"\n      - \"Fig: Strategy specificity heatmap (benchmark × sparsity × model) demonstrating systematic attenuation from MATH-500 (15×) → GSM8K (3×) → GPQA (3×).\"\n    analysis: >\n      GPQA 完整数据将强化 C10 的叙事方向：phase gradient 跨 benchmark 稳健（3/3 monotonic），\n      但 strategy specificity 高度 task-dependent（15× → 3× → 3×）。论文 Discussion 需要\n      一段专门解释 specificity 衰减的可能机制：更短的推理链 → phase boundary 更模糊 →\n      random eviction 在\"错误\" phase 的概率上升 → imp/rand 区分缩小。这是 median 档要求\n      的 \"softened language\" 之一：不能说 \"strategy specificity is a universal property\"，\n      必须限定为 \"strongest on complex mathematical reasoning with long CoT\"。\n\n  - name: \"qwen25_14b_math500\"\n    plan_id: \"14b_scale_extension\"\n    description: \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct × MATH-500 × importance(×4 sparsity) + random(s030) = 5 runs\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 50\n      importance:\n        s015:\n          median_diff: 0.055\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.008\n          cohens_d: 0.42\n        s020:\n          median_diff: 0.28\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.0003\n          cohens_d: 0.68\n        s025:\n          median_diff: 0.92\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n          cohens_d: 1.05\n        s030:\n          median_diff: 2.35\n          wilcoxon_p: 0.0001\n          cohens_d: 1.28\n      random_s030:\n        median_diff: 0.68\n        wilcoxon_p: 0.02\n        phase_gradient_dz: 0.38\n      imp_rand_ratio_s030: 3.5\n      dose_response_monotonic: true\n      dose_response_spearman_rho: 1.0\n      phase_gradient_importance_dz:\n        s015: 0.85\n        s020: 0.92\n        s025: 1.02\n        s030: 0.95\n      onset_threshold: \"s015 (similar to QW-7B)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      14B 模型相对 7B 有更多 attention heads (40→40 for 14B GQA, 但 KV heads 从 8→8)，\n      实际 GQA 结构意味着 head pruning 的冗余度不同。预期：(1) Phase gradient 依然 monotonic\n      且 d_z~1.0（与 Qwen2-7B 一致，因为 phase modulation 是 reasoning structure 的属性，\n      不强依赖模型规模）；(2) Absolute magnitude 可能比 7B 略小（14B 更鲁棒，residual stream\n      容量更大）——median_diff ~2.35 vs 7B 的 3.16 at s030；(3) Strategy specificity ratio\n      ~3.5×（14B random 也更难产生大 gradient，因为冗余更多）；(4) Onset threshold 仍在 s015\n      （与 7B Qwen 一致，架构决定而非规模决定）。Median 档预期：这个实验不会 dramatically 改变\n      故事，但为 Limitations 中的 \"7B only\" 提供部分回应。Cohen's d 范围 0.42→1.28 落在\n      qw_cohens_d_range [0.37, 1.44] 内。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 14B vs 7B Qwen importance dose-response\"\n        columns: [\"sparsity\", \"QW-7B_median_diff (n=500)\", \"QW-14B_predicted (n=50)\", \"ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s015\", \"0.066\", \"0.055\", \"0.83×\"]\n          - [\"s020\", \"0.307\", \"0.28\", \"0.91×\"]\n          - [\"s025\", \"1.075\", \"0.92\", \"0.86×\"]\n          - [\"s030\", \"3.155\", \"2.35\", \"0.74×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Dual dose-response curve (7B vs 14B) with shared x-axis (sparsity) showing parallel scaling with 14B ~20-25% lower magnitude.\"\n    analysis: >\n      14B 实验是 reviewer concern RC1 (7B only) 的直接回应。Median 档预期：定性完全复制\n      （monotonic, strategy×phase interaction），定量略弱（magnitude ~75-90% of 7B）。\n      论文加一句：\"Preliminary results on Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct (n=50) replicate the\n      monotonic phase gradient (Spearman ρ=1.0, all d_z>0.8), suggesting the phenomenon\n      is not scale-specific within the 7-14B range. Larger-scale validation remains\n      future work.\" 这足够回应 reviewer 而不需要 14B 的完整 n=500 replication。\n\n  - name: \"c10_lang_s020_s025_analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"c10_lang_s020_s025\"\n    description: \"MATH-500 language switching at s020/s025, 补全 dense→s015→s020→s025→s030 全链\"\n    expected_results:\n      s020:\n        switch_rate: 0.14\n        cn_count: 7\n        en_count: 43\n        cn_acc: 0.33\n        en_acc: 0.25\n      s025:\n        switch_rate: 0.32\n        cn_count: 16\n        en_count: 34\n        cn_acc: 0.20\n        en_acc: 0.057\n      full_chain_switch_rate: [0.0, 0.04, 0.14, 0.32, 0.40]\n      monotonic: true\n      correlation_switch_vs_ii: 0.55\n    result_rationale: >\n      这个实验已经完成（registry 显示 success）。实际结果与 median 档吻合：language switching\n      单调递增 (0%→4%→14%→32%→40%)，是 compound degradation 的 behavioral manifestation。\n      Switch rate 与 II 相关但不完美(r≈0.55)——因为 switching 是离散二元事件而 II 是连续量，\n      且 switching 受模型 tokenizer 双语 capability 影响（architecture-specific confound）。\n      Median 档解读：这个数据支持论文的 Discussion 段落（compound sparsity 不仅影响数值推理\n      能力，还影响 language coherence），但不能作为独立 claim——它是 severity 的 symptom 而非\n      独立发现。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Language switching dose-response\"\n        columns: [\"sparsity\", \"switch_rate\", \"cn_acc\", \"en_acc\", \"overall_acc\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"dense\", \"0%\", \"N/A\", \"0.52\", \"0.52\"]\n          - [\"s015\", \"4%\", \"0%\", \"0.375\", \"0.36\"]\n          - [\"s020\", \"14%\", \"0.33\", \"0.25\", \"0.26\"]\n          - [\"s025\", \"32%\", \"0.20\", \"0.057\", \"0.10\"]\n          - [\"s030\", \"40%\", \"0.10\", \"0.10\", \"0.10\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Dual-axis plot—left axis: accuracy decline; right axis: Chinese switching rate. Both monotonic, showing compound sparsity triggers multilingual collapse.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Language switching 数据已完成，为 Appendix 提供额外 behavioral evidence。\n      不改变核心 claims。Median 档下，这属于 'nice-to-have supplementary evidence' 而非\n      论文主线。§6 Discussion 加一段提及即可。\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_think_validation\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_think_validation\"\n    description: \"GPQA Diamond </think> phase segmentation validation (Run 2, supplementary)\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      n_valid: 180\n      median_kappa: 0.82\n      thinking_in_low_sparsity_phase: 0.72\n      answer_in_high_sparsity_phase: 0.58\n      temporal_ordering: 0.51\n    result_rationale: >\n      GPQA 的 </think> validation 预期 kappa 略低于 MATH-500 (0.88)——GPQA 是多选题，\n      推理链结构更不规则（有些问题直接选答案，有些有长推理）。Kappa=0.82 仍在 'substantial\n      agreement' 范围。thinking_in_low=0.72（低于 MATH-500 的 0.82）因为 GPQA 推理链更短\n      导致 low-sparsity phase 混合了更多 transition 内容。Answer_in_high=0.58（低于\n      MATH-500 的 0.66）因为 GPQA 答案部分通常只有一个字母选项，token 数极少，phase\n      assignment 更不稳定。Temporal ordering 更低（0.51 vs 0.58）因为 GPQA 非线性推理\n      较多（排除法、回溯等）。这些都是 median 档预期——kappa 仍然 acceptable 但 phase\n      alignment 指标比数学弱。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Appendix figure showing kappa distribution across GPQA problems (histogram) vs MATH-500 overlay.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Supplementary validation，放 Appendix。如果 kappa<0.75 则需要承认 quantile \n      segmentation 在 GPQA 上不如 MATH-500 可靠——但 0.82 仍然足够支持主结论。\n      不影响论文主线 claims。\n```\n\n**总结**：\n\nMedian 档下，5 个 running/planned 实验的预测核心结论：\n1. **c8_llama_n250**: 不改变 partially_confirmed 判定——CI 缩窄但效应量不变（d_z≈0.33），仅 s030 Bonferroni 显著\n2. **GPQA Diamond**: Phase gradient 复现（第 3 个 monotonic benchmark），但 specificity ratio 衰减至 2-4×\n3. **14B Qwen**: 定性复制 7B，magnitude 略弱（~75-85%），为 RC1 提供部分回应\n4. **Language switching**: 已完成，作为 supplementary evidence 放 Appendix\n5. **GPQA think validation**: Kappa ~0.82，acceptable 但弱于 MATH-500","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"26848798-3f45-4312-987c-61341c081737","total_cost_usd":0.9751949999999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":74742,"cache_read_input_tokens":391249,"output_tokens":10457,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":74742,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":8930,"cache_read_input_tokens":83040,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3149,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_